Reading: the image's own process setup sets BROWSER=/usr/local/bin/open-vnc-browser-url.sh for the server process even when
the container is started with BROWSER empty, so an AutoByteus server image node always reports true (REQ-002: "A node from
the AutoByteus server Docker image ... reports yes"). This container cannot simulate a headless node; the "no desktop" answer
is covered by the rule's unit matrix (IMP-02) and the browser probe's headless backend (ARP-08). Not a defect.
